{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"If she is in there than Solomon is out.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:48:13.585000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T07:48:26.043000Z","id":"738301915263402035","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"He's out? On the sub?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:48:25.725000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T07:48:35.831000Z","id":"738301966182121493","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The mirror can only hold one soul at time. And is exchanged with one command word and expelled with another. First we must tell castor. I would not hide this danger from him. But we also must discover Solomon's secret word.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:50:05.890000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T07:50:15.412000Z","id":"738302386304712767","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I should be the one to tell Castor\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:50:34.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738302505884188683","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web looks at Ebuc and nods.","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:50:43.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738302543473541171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
